    of any Practice or therapist, for third-party services including video,
    payment, calendar, email and SMS providers, or for loss caused by your failure
    to keep your own records and backups.
  </p>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent the law allows, we are not liable for indirect,
    incidental, special or consequential loss, or for lost profits, revenue,
    goodwill or anticipated savings. Our total liability arising out of these
    terms in any 12-month period is limited to the fees you paid us in the
